Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    Caption: SirGate - SIR version gate (newer-only refusal with a loud diagnostic)
    Capabilities: Sys.Output

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: SirSupported
        Returns: sup

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Newest supported SIR major
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: maj

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Newest supported SIR minor
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 11
            Returns: min

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Supported version contract
            Op: Core.Map
            Params: "major", maj, "minor", min, "sir", "0.11.1", "compiler", "0.2.2"
            Returns: sup

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            State: Ok
            Returns: sup

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: SirGate
        Params: src
        Returns: gatedSrc

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Line separator for source scan
            Op: Core.Chr
            Params: 10
            Returns: nl

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Supported contract for messages and compare
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: SirSupported
            Returns: sup

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Supported major
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: sup, "major"
            Returns: supMaj

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Supported minor
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: sup, "minor"
            Returns: supMin

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Supported SIR label
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: sup, "sir"
            Returns: supSir

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Own compiler label
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: sup, "compiler"
            Returns: supComp

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Source length bounds the scan
            Op: Core.StrLen
            Params: src
            Returns: n

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Scan position starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: pos

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: No version seen yet
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: ""
            Returns: ver

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Outside Context until proven inside
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: inCtx

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: No depth-zero block seen yet
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: sawTop

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while position is inside
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: pos, n
            Returns: cont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Hop line to line for a depth-zero Context version claim
            Condition: cont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Find the next line end from here
                    Op: Core.StrFind
                    Params: src, nl, pos
                    Returns: eol

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Missing end means the last line
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: eol, -1
                    Returns: eolNeg

                Branch
                    Condition: eolNeg
                    TrueBlock
                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Op: Core.Sub
                            Params: n, pos
                            Returns: span
                    FalseBlock
                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Op: Core.Sub
                            Params: eol, pos
                            Returns: span

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current line
                    Op: Core.StrSub
                    Params: src, pos, span
                    Returns: ln

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Skip empty lines silently
                    Op: Core.StrLen
                    Params: ln
                    Returns: llen

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Non-empty lines carry structure
                    Op: Core.Gt
                    Params: llen, 0
                    Returns: nonEmpty

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Structure or silence
                    Condition: nonEmpty

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: First character tells depth
                            Op: Core.StrSub
                            Params: ln, 0, 1
                            Returns: ch0

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Indented lines live inside a block
                            Op: Core.Eq
                            Params: ch0, " "
                            Returns: indented

                        Branch
                            Type: Branch
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Inside a block or at depth zero
                            Condition: indented

                            TrueBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Only Context interior counts
                                    Op: Core.Eq
                                    Params: inCtx, 1
                                    Returns: ctxOn

                                Branch
                                    Type: Branch
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Version claim or ordinary property
                                    Condition: ctxOn

                                    TrueBlock
                                        Type: Section
                                        Role: Content

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Look for the version property
                                            Op: Core.StrFind
                                            Params: ln, "DocumentVersion:"
                                            Returns: dvIdx

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Absent marker means no claim here
                                            Op: Core.Eq
                                            Params: dvIdx, -1
                                            Returns: noDv

                                        Branch
                                            Type: Branch
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Claim or pass-through
                                            Condition: noDv

                                            TrueBlock
                                                Type: Section
                                                Role: Content

                                                Instruction
                                                    Type: Instruction
                                                    Role: Content
                                                    Caption: Version unchanged
                                                    Op: Core.Id
                                                    Params: ver
                                                    Returns: ver

                                                Instruction
                                                    Type: Instruction
                                                    Role: Content
                                                    Caption: Context unchanged
                                                    Op: Core.Id
                                                    Params: inCtx
                                                    Returns: inCtx

                                            FalseBlock
                                                Type: Section
                                                Role: Content

                                                Instruction
                                                    Type: Instruction
                                                    Role: Content
                                                    Caption: First claim wins on multi-doc input
                                                    Op: Core.Eq
                                                    Params: ver, ""
                                                    Returns: verEmpty

                                                Branch
                                                    Condition: verEmpty
                                                    TrueBlock
                                                        Instruction
                                                            Type: Instruction
                                                            Role: Content
                                                            Caption: Value starts past the colon and space
                                                            Op: Core.Add
                                                            Params: dvIdx, 17
                                                            Returns: vs

                                                        Instruction
                                                            Type: Instruction
                                                            Role: Content
                                                            Caption: Value runs to line end
                                                            Op: Core.Sub
                                                            Params: llen, vs
                                                            Returns: vlen

                                                        Instruction
                                                            Type: Instruction
                                                            Role: Content
                                                            Caption: Take the declared version
                                                            Op: Core.StrSub
                                                            Params: ln, vs, vlen
                                                            Returns: ver

                                                        Instruction
                                                            Type: Instruction
                                                            Role: Content
                                                            Caption: Context unchanged
                                                            Op: Core.Id
                                                            Params: inCtx
                                                            Returns: inCtx

                                                    FalseBlock
                                                        Instruction
                                                            Type: Instruction
                                                            Role: Content
                                                            Op: Core.Id
                                                            Params: ver
                                                            Returns: ver

                                                        Instruction
                                                            Type: Instruction
                                                            Role: Content
                                                            Op: Core.Id
                                                            Params: inCtx
                                                            Returns: inCtx

                                    FalseBlock
                                        Type: Section
                                        Role: Content

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Version unchanged
                                            Op: Core.Id
                                            Params: ver
                                            Returns: ver

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Context unchanged
                                            Op: Core.Id
                                            Params: inCtx
                                            Returns: inCtx

                            FalseBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Depth-zero Context opens the claim zone
                                    Op: Core.Eq
                                    Params: ln, "Context"
                                    Returns: isCtx

                                Branch
                                    Type: Branch
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Enter or leave the claim zone
                                    Condition: isCtx

                                    TrueBlock
                                        Type: Section
                                        Role: Content

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Inside Context now
                                            Op: Core.Lit
                                            Params: 1
                                            Returns: inCtx

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: A depth-zero block exists
                                            Op: Core.Lit
                                            Params: 1
                                            Returns: sawTop

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Version unchanged
                                            Op: Core.Id
                                            Params: ver
                                            Returns: ver

                                    FalseBlock
                                        Type: Section
                                        Role: Content

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Any other depth-zero block closes it
                                            Op: Core.Lit
                                            Params: 0
                                            Returns: inCtx

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: A depth-zero block exists
                                            Op: Core.Lit
                                            Params: 1
                                            Returns: sawTop

                                        Instruction
                                            Type: Instruction
                                            Role: Content
                                            Caption: Version unchanged
                                            Op: Core.Id
                                            Params: ver
                                            Returns: ver

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Version unchanged
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: ver
                            Returns: ver

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Context unchanged
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: inCtx
                            Returns: inCtx

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Hop past the line end
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: eol, 1
                    Returns: posNext

                Branch
                    Condition: eolNeg
                    TrueBlock
                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: n
                            Returns: pos
                    FalseBlock
                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: posNext
                            Returns: pos

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: pos, n
                    Returns: cont

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Empty claim means no declaration
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: ver, ""
            Returns: missingRaw

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Degenerate whitespace-only input has no top block
            Op: Core.Gt
            Params: sawTop, 0
            Returns: hasTop

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Missing counts only on real input
            Op: Core.And
            Params: hasTop, missingRaw
            Returns: missing

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Declared or missing
            Condition: missing

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Missing-declaration diagnostic
                    Op: Core.StrConcat
                    Params: "No SIR version declared. Add a Context header with DocumentVersion. This compiler is ", supComp, " and supports SIR up to ", supSir, "."
                    Returns: msg

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Say it loudly on the channel
                    Op: Sys.Output
                    Params: msg
                    Returns: said

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Refusal stub carries the diagnostic
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: SirRefusal, msg
                    Returns: gatedSrc

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Split the dotted version
                    Op: Core.StrSplit
                    Params: ver, "."
                    Returns: parts

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Need at least major and minor
                    Op: Core.ListLen
                    Params: parts
                    Returns: plen

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Short claim is malformed
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: plen, 2
                    Returns: malformed

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Well-formed or malformed
                    Condition: malformed

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Branch
                            Type: Branch
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Degenerate input passes silently
                            Condition: hasTop

                            TrueBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Malformed-declaration diagnostic
                                    Op: Core.StrConcat
                                    Params: "Bad SIR version declared. Add a Context header with DocumentVersion like 0.11.1. This compiler is ", supComp, " and supports SIR up to ", supSir, "."
                                    Returns: msg

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Say it loudly on the channel
                                    Op: Sys.Output
                                    Params: msg
                                    Returns: said

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Refusal stub carries the diagnostic
                                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                                    Params: SirRefusal, msg
                                    Returns: gatedSrc

                            FalseBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Nothing to gate passes through
                                    Op: Core.Id
                                    Params: src
                                    Returns: gatedSrc

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Declared major text
                            Op: Core.ListGet
                            Params: parts, 0
                            Returns: smaj

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Declared minor text
                            Op: Core.ListGet
                            Params: parts, 1
                            Returns: smin

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Declared major number
                            Op: Core.StrParse
                            Params: smaj
                            Returns: maj

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Declared minor number
                            Op: Core.StrParse
                            Params: smin
                            Returns: min

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Newer major is always newer
                            Op: Core.Gt
                            Params: maj, supMaj
                            Returns: majNewer

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Same major allows minor compare
                            Op: Core.Eq
                            Params: maj, supMaj
                            Returns: majEq

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Newer minor under same major
                            Op: Core.Gt
                            Params: min, supMin
                            Returns: minNewer

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Minor verdict counts on equal major
                            Op: Core.And
                            Params: majEq, minNewer
                            Returns: minNewerEq

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Newer on either axis
                            Op: Core.Or
                            Params: majNewer, minNewerEq
                            Returns: newer

                        Branch
                            Type: Branch
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Newer or covered
                            Condition: newer

                            TrueBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Newer-version diagnostic
                                    Op: Core.StrConcat
                                    Params: "SIR ", ver, " needs a newer compiler. This compiler is ", supComp, " and supports SIR up to ", supSir, "."
                                    Returns: msg

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Say it loudly on the channel
                                    Op: Sys.Output
                                    Params: msg
                                    Returns: said

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Refusal stub carries the diagnostic
                                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                                    Params: SirRefusal, msg
                                    Returns: gatedSrc

                            FalseBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Covered version passes through
                                    Op: Core.Id
                                    Params: src
                                    Returns: gatedSrc

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Gated source text
            State: Ok
            Returns: gatedSrc

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: SirRefusal
        Params: msg
        Returns: stub

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Line separator for stub assembly
            Op: Core.Chr
            Params: 10
            Returns: nl

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Stub head with a current version claim
            Op: Core.StrConcat
            Params: "Context", nl, "    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1", nl, "    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1", nl, "Module", nl, "    Type: Module", nl, "    Role: Content", nl
            Returns: head

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Stub body opens the function
            Op: Core.StrConcat
            Params: "    Caption: Version refusal notice", nl, "    Capabilities: Sys.Output", nl, "    Function", nl, "        Name: main", nl, "        Returns: o", nl, "        Instruction", nl
            Returns: mid

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Stub literal carries the diagnostic
            Op: Core.StrConcat
            Params: "            Type: Instruction", nl, "            Role: Content", nl, "            Op: Core.Lit", nl, "            Params: "", msg, """, nl, "            Returns: m", nl
            Returns: lit

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Stub tail prints and returns
            Op: Core.StrConcat
            Params: "        Instruction", nl, "            Type: Instruction", nl, "            Role: Content", nl, "            Op: Sys.Output", nl, "            Params: m", nl, "            Returns: o", nl, "        Result", nl, "            Type: Result", nl, "            Role: Content", nl, "            State: Ok", nl, "            Returns: o", nl
            Returns: tail

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Assemble the refusal program
            Op: Core.StrConcat
            Params: head, mid, lit, tail
            Returns: stub

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Refusal program text
            State: Ok
            Returns: stub
